<p>&#8230; of couse, since the Foundation is NOT government.</p>
<p>Now if I'm going to suggest a media similar to the Foundation, I would suggest old 1989 - 1996 manga <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spriggan_(manga)" target="_blank">Spriggan</a>. But since it's action series, it's a little closer to what happen if GOC and the Foundation actually merged into one organization (the hero try to recover/contain anomalous, but usually has to neutralize it to prevent disaster).</p>

